R11 candidate cathode drive and static fault boundaries
* Generic BJT only. High-voltage vendor hot leakage and secondary breakdown not represented.
* Independent 10 uA + 5 uA hot/tri-state boundary current assumptions.
.param VO=2.27 RO=0.1 BF0=25
VHV hv 0 170
VSTRIKE hv arc 104
R1 arc mid 10k
R2 mid c 10k
VOUT driver 0 PWL(0 0 100u 0 101u {VO} 700u {VO} 701u 0)
RDRV driver pin {RO}
RBASE pin b 3030
RPD b 0 9900
VBASE b bi 0
Q1 c bi 0 NPN_BOUND
.model NPN_BOUND NPN(IS=3e-15 BF={BF0} VAF=60 IKF=.03 RB=25 RC=4 RE=.5 CJE=12p CJC=4p TF=.6n)
Ihot 0 hot 15u
RPDHOT hot 0 10.1k
Ileak 0 floating 15u
Rmissing floating 0 100Meg
Dclamp floating 0 DCLAMP
.model DCLAMP D(IS=3e-15)
* Shared-rail load step, bounded no converter response for 50 us.
Iall rail 0 PULSE(0 36.36m 100u 10n 10n 50u 1m)
Crail rail 0 44u IC=3.3
Rrail rail vs 100Meg
Vrail vs 0 3.3
* Supply-sequence diode is a qualitative stand-in, no Ioff claim.
Vin GPIO 0 3.3
Rsrc GPIO unclamped 100
Dseq unclamped offrail DCLAMP
Rload offrail 0 1k
.temp 85
.tran 200n 1m 0 200n uic
.meas tran voh FIND v(pin) AT=500u
.meas tran ib_on FIND i(VBASE) AT=500u
.meas tran collector_on FIND par('(v(mid)-v(c))/10000') AT=500u
.meas tran vce_on FIND v(c) AT=500u
.meas tran collector_off FIND par('(v(mid)-v(c))/10000') AT=900u
.meas tran base_tristate FIND v(hot) AT=900u
.meas tran base_no_pd FIND v(floating) AT=900u
.meas tran droop_v FIND v(rail) AT=150u
.meas tran unpowered_rail_v FIND v(offrail) AT=900u
.meas tran clamp_drive_a FIND i(Vin) AT=900u
.end

